[{"answer":"Ah Caroline... come on in. Sit down.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Thanks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/2.mp3"},{"answer":"So how's the dissertation planning going?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Well Dr Schulmann, I'm still having a lot of trouble deciding on a title.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, that's perfectly normal at this stage.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/5.mp3"},{"answer":"And this is what your tutorials will help you to do.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/7.mp3"},{"answer":"What we'll do is jot down some points that might help you in your decision.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/8.mp3"},{"answer":"First of all, you have chosen your general topic area, haven't you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, it's the fishing industry.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/10.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh yes, that was one of the areas you mentioned.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, what aspects of the course are you good at?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I think I'm coping well with statistics,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/13.mp3"},{"answer":"and I'm never bored by it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Good. Anything else?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I found computer modelling fascinating -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/16.mp3"},{"answer":"I have no problem following what's being taught,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/17.mp3"},{"answer":"whereas quite a few of my classmates find it difficult.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, that's very good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you think these might be areas you could bring into your dissertation?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh yes, if possible.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/21.mp3"},{"answer":"It's just that I'm having difficulty thinking how I can do that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/22.mp3"},{"answer":"You see, I feel I don't have sufficient background information.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/23.mp3"},{"answer":"I see.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, do you take notes?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/25.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm very weak at note-taking.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/26.mp3"},{"answer":"My teachers always used to say that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I think you really need to work on these weaknesses before you go any further.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/28.mp3"},{"answer":"What do you suggest?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/29.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I can go through the possible strategies with you and let you decide where to go from there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/30.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, thanks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/31.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, some people find it helpful to organise peer-group discussions -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/32.mp3"},{"answer":"you know, each week a different person studies a different topic and shares it with the group.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/33.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/34.mp3"},{"answer":"It really helps build confidence, you know, having to present something to others.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/35.mp3"},{"answer":"I can see that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/36.mp3"},{"answer":"The drawback is that everyone in the group seems to share the same ideas...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/37.mp3"},{"answer":"they keep being repeated in all the dissertations.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/38.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/39.mp3"},{"answer":"You could also try a service called 'Student Support'.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/40.mp3"},{"answer":"It's designed to give you a structured programme over a number of weeks to develop your skills.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/41.mp3"},{"answer":"Sounds good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/42.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, unfortunately there are only a few places.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/43.mp3"},{"answer":"But it's worth looking into.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, of course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/45.mp3"},{"answer":"I know I've got to work on my study skills.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/46.mp3"},{"answer":"And then there are several study skills books you can consult.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/47.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/48.mp3"},{"answer":"They'll be a good source of reference","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/49.mp3"},{"answer":"but the problem is they are sometimes too general.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/50.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, that's what I've found.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/51.mp3"},{"answer":"Other than that, I would strongly advise quite simple ideas like using a card index.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/52.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, yes, I've never done that before.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/53.mp3"},{"answer":"It's simple, but it really works because you have to get points down in a small space.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/54.mp3"},{"answer":"Another thing I always advise is don't just take your notes and forget about them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Read everything three times - that'll really fix them in your mind.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/56.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I can see it'd take discipline but...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/57.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, if you establish good study skills at this stage, they'll be with you all your life.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/58.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh yes. I completely agree.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/59.mp3"},{"answer":"It's just that I don't seem to be able to discipline myself.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/60.mp3"},{"answer":"I need to talk things over.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/61.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, we'll be continuing these tutorials of course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/62.mp3"},{"answer":"Let's arrange next month's now. Let's see...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/63.mp3"},{"answer":"I can see you virtually any time during the week starting the 22nd of January.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/64.mp3"},{"answer":"What about the 24th?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/65.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm free in the afternoon.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/66.mp3"},{"answer":"Sorry, I'm booked then.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/67.mp3"},{"answer":"What about the following day?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/68.mp3"},{"answer":"The Thursday?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/69.mp3"},{"answer":"I can make the morning.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/70.mp3"},{"answer":"Fine, we'll go for the 25th then.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/71.mp3"},{"answer":"That's great, thanks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-3-part-3-2023-07-23-16-25-38/72.mp3"}]
